ll the rules are for.  When a sudden rumbling comes from above, he sneaks up toward the human world to see what’s happening. His little sister Borra follows him, and what begins as an innocent mischief-filled outing for the two of them quickly turns into a grand adventure—full of danger, magic, and experiences greater than anything Krølle Bølle could ever have dreamed of.","descriptionEn":null,"isOwnContent":null,"duration":null,"creatorCinemaId":null,"posterImageRef":null,"posterImageUrl":null,"backdropImageRef":null,"backdropImageUrl":null,"ageRating":null,"trailerUrl":null,"isRegularEvent":false,"hasMarketingAssistantBooked":false,"futureShowingsCount":2897,"premiereDate":"2026-11-05T00:00:00Z","cineamoMovie":null,"movieId":1200562,"metrics":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.cineamo.com/contents/1772010"}}},"cinema":{"id":337,"name":"Cinema Ahaus","shortName":"Cinema Ahaus","slug":"cinema-ahaus","description":"Willkommen im Cinema Ahaus! Wir bieten Ihnen ein breites Spektrum an aktuellen Blockbustern, spannenden Sneak Previews und besonderen Filmreihen. Unsere modernen Kinosäle sorgen für ein komfortables Filmerlebnis, begleitet von frischem Popcorn und erfrischenden Getränken von unserer Kinotheke. Genießen Sie regelmäßig Sonderveranstaltungen wie Filmkunst, Seniorenkino und Frauenkino. Besuchen Sie uns und erleben Sie unvergessliche Kinomomente.","phone":"+4925615964","street":"Schloßstraße 16-18","postalCode":"48683","city":"Ahaus","state":"Nordrhein-Westfalen","stateAbbr":"NW","country":"Deutschland","countryCode":"DE","currencyCode":"EUR","longitude":7.00409985,"latitude":52.07460022,"distance":null,"profileImageRef":"5c614bd1-26a1-49cd-9abb-2e3aa0d1d2bc","profileImageUrl":"https://cdn.cineamo.com/cinema-profile-image/5c614bd1-26a1-49cd-9abb-2e3aa0d1d2bc","logoImageRef":"288693c4-eb9e-45a5-b261-1b12db8b1e8d","logoImageUrl":"https://cdn.cineamo.com/cinema-logo-image/288693c4-eb9e-45a5-b261-1b12db8b1e8d","logoWideImageRef":"456cf175-4599-418b-abdc-3a8